cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it as below, together with the papers
  listed under Citation in the README.
type: software
title: "Conditional genetic correlations with Genomic SEM"
abstract: >-
  R code and a step-by-step tutorial for estimating conditional genetic
  correlations with Genomic SEM: the genetic correlation between two traits
  conditioned on a third, with a significance test for the difference between
  the marginal and conditional estimate, fitted in both orientations, and a
  batch workflow for many trait pairs and conditioning traits.
authors:
  - family-names: Romero
    given-names: Cato
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Complex Trait Genetics, Center for Neurogenomics and
      Cognitive Research, Amsterdam Neuroscience, Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cro280/Conditional-Genetic-Correlation"
keywords:
  - genetic correlation
  - conditional genetic correlation
  - Genomic SEM
  - LD score regression
  - GWAS
  - pleiotropy
  - comorbidity
